WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Sarah Watts: Hi Tom, hi Emily — thanks for making time today. I'd love to understand how your team handles customer onboarding right now.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Tom Reyes: Thanks Sarah. So our onboarding flow is mostly manual. We spend about 3 hours per day on data entry across the team, which is a huge time sink.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Emily Chen: And the accuracy is a real problem. Last month we had 40% of our records with missing information, which makes reporting basically impossible.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Sarah Watts: That's a significant pain point. What tools are you using today to manage this?

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Tom Reyes: We're on spreadsheets mostly. I know, it's embarrassing. We tried a CRM last year but the migration failed and we never went back.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Emily Chen: The budget for new tools is capped at $30k this quarter, so we need to be careful about what we commit to.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Sarah Watts: Got it — a $30k budget cap. Our platform starts at $19 per user per month, and for a team your size that would be well within budget.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Tom Reyes: What about implementation? We can't afford another 3-month rollout.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Sarah Watts: Most teams are fully onboarded in under a week. We handle the data migration for you at no extra cost.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Emily Chen: That's reassuring. One thing we'd need is SSO integration — we can't roll anything out without single sign-on.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Sarah Watts: SSO is included in the Pro plan. I'll send you the full feature comparison after this call.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Tom Reyes: Great. Can we set up a demo for the wider team next week?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Sarah Watts: Absolutely — I'll schedule a 30-minute demo for Tuesday or Thursday. I'll send a calendar invite today.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:52.000
Emily Chen: Perfect. And could you also send the security documentation? Our legal team will need to review it.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:03:02.000
Sarah Watts: Of course — SOC 2 Type 2, GDPR compliance docs, all of it goes over today.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Tom Reyes: One more question — what does support look like after we sign? We've been burned before by vendors who disappear after onboarding.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Sarah Watts: You get a dedicated customer success manager plus 24/7 chat support. Our median response time is under 2 hours.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Emily Chen: That's impressive. I think we have enough to move forward.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Tom Reyes: Agreed. Sarah, can you also prepare a pricing proposal for 25 seats?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:48.000
Sarah Watts: Yes — I'll send the proposal with 25-seat pricing by tomorrow. And I'll follow up with the calendar invite and security docs today.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:52.000
Emily Chen: Wonderful. Thanks for the quick call, Sarah.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:58.000
Sarah Watts: Thank you both! Talk soon.
